// THESIS: prompts and recipes form a reusable creative notebook. OWN-WORLD: white reading surface, violet indexes, photographic marginalia. STORY: keep language and versions together rather than separating a long form from a queue. FIRST VIEWPORT: note index left, document center, image versions right. FORM: document with recipe annotations. Static visual exploration only.
function renderNotebook(){return `<main class="shell notebook">${brandHeader('创作笔记')}<div class="notebook-layout"><aside class="note-index"><h3>创作记录</h3><div class="note-link selected">晨光与蓝色陶瓷<small>当前草稿 · 3 条提示词</small></div><div class="note-link">雨后的街角<small>历史批次 · 点击载入的位置</small></div><div class="note-link">山间的小屋<small>历史批次 · 12 张作品</small></div><div class="rule"><p class="hint">新增创作<br>提示词历史<br>收藏作品<br>本地文件</p></div><div class="hardware">本地 ComfyUI<br>RTX 5070 Ti · 16GB<br>系统日志 / 服务设置</div></aside><section class="paper"><div class="paper-title"><small>创作草稿 / 静物摄影</small><h1>晨光与蓝色陶瓷</h1><p class="hint">把一个想法写清楚，留下配方，再看看它能长出多少种画面。</p></div><div class="note-controls"><span class="pill">FLUX.2 klein 4B　⌄</span><span class="plain-static">已保存到演示笔记</span><span class="mock-action" style="margin-left:auto">提示词历史</span></div><section class="note-section"><div class="row spread"><h2>画面描述</h2><small>每段一条 / 也可粘贴多行</small></div><div class="writing-line"><span class="number">01</span><p>晨光里的橘猫，蓝色陶瓷花瓶，浅景深。窗外的光照亮毛发，室内保持安静。</p></div><div class="writing-line"><span class="number">02</span><p>窗边的白色花朵，柔和侧光。背景中的蓝色花瓶与木桌形成自然的层次。</p></div><div class="writing-line"><span class="number">03</span><p>木质书桌、书本和一杯咖啡，午后阳光穿过窗帘，真实生活的质感。</p></div></section><section class="inline-recipe"><div class="row spread"><h3>这一页的生成配方</h3><span class="plain-static">恢复模型推荐</span></div>${recipeGrid('1024 × 1024 · 1:1','4','1','3')}<p class="hint" style="margin-top:16px">FP8 蒸馏版建议 4 步；CFG 1。切换模型同步更新等待任务。<br>种子 −1 · 每张独立随机　/　前缀、后缀与更多参数</p></section><div class="row spread" style="margin-top:24px"><small>3 条画面描述，共 9 张图片</small><span class="mock-action primary">${uiIcon('arrow')} 开始这一组创作</span></div><section class="note-history"><h2>生成记录</h2><div class="row spread"><span class="state-label">当前 · 示意</span><small>Qwen-Image 2.1 · 原任务继续</small></div><p class="hint">第一组正在生成。6 个等待任务已使用 FLUX.2 配方。</p><div class="row plain-static"><span>暂停 / 恢复</span><span>打乱等待</span><span>停止当前</span><span>清空队列</span></div><p class="hint">队列单项支持置顶、跳过和删除，作品不会随队列清空。</p></section></section><aside class="versions"><div class="section-head"><h2>这一页的作品</h2><span class="plain-static">导出</span></div><div class="static-tabs"><span class="current">全部</span><span>收藏</span><span>隐藏点踩</span></div><figure><img src="../assets/flux2.png" alt="晨光橘猫，FLUX.2 实际测试输出"><figcaption><strong>晨光里的橘猫</strong><span>收藏 / 下载</span></figcaption><small>FLUX.2 klein 4B · 1024 × 1024</small></figure><dl class="meta"><dt>种子</dt><dd>0</dd><dt>比例 / 步数</dt><dd>1:1 / 4</dd><dt>首次耗时</dt><dd>31.76 秒（含加载）</dd></dl><figure><img src="../assets/qwen.png" alt="橘猫与花瓶，Qwen 实际测试输出"><figcaption><strong>蓝色花瓶与猫</strong><span>更多详情</span></figcaption><small>Qwen-Image 2.1 · 768 × 768</small></figure><p class="hint">作品来自已完成的本机模型测试，仅用于原型展示。可复用原始提示词和模型。</p></aside></div></main>`;}
